meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded your speech for the video.","calls":[],"decisionMs":306.80666700000074,"totalMs":306.8134170000012,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the first point about a written agenda.","calls":[],"decisionMs":340.6366249999992,"totalMs":340.64337499999965,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the second habit about people arriving prepared.","calls":[],"decisionMs":356.76537499999904,"totalMs":356.7724999999991,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the third habit about meetings disappearing from the calendar.","calls":[],"decisionMs":353.34316599999875,"totalMs":353.3508329999968,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":false,"failures":["serious: still recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"Cut.","calls":[],"decisionMs":299.0249159999985,"totalMs":299.03245799999786,"steps":1,"generatedTokens