hat, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the third point about ending with names and dates.","calls":[],"decisionMs":420.28958299999795,"totalMs":420.304874999998,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the fourth point about preparation and confidence.","calls":[],"decisionMs":398.7349580000009,"totalMs":398.74133300000176,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I recorded the closing remarks and thank you message.","calls":[],"decisionMs":410.523624999998,"totalMs":410.53145799999766,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":false,"failures":["serious: still recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"Cut.","calls":[],"decisionMs":351.10670799999934,"totalMs":351.11483299999963,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":3,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I see 1840 photos left and 5400 seconds of video left on the card.","calls":[],"decisionMs":523.3356249999997,"totalMs":523.343208000002,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last two clips.","kind":"r